<title>USA: Foundation Health antitrust period expires.</title>
<headline>Foundation Health antitrust period expires.</headline>
<dateline>PUEBLO, Colo. 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foundation Health Corp said Friday that the antitrust waiting period for its proposed $3 billion merger with Health Systems International Inc expired.</p>
<p>Foundation Health said this clearance is a significant step in completing the deal, which was first announced in October.</p>
<p>The &quot;merger-of-equals&quot; remains subject to stockholder approvals as well as other federal and state regulatory approvals, Foundation Health said.</p>
</text>
